OL,3,GNEWSASwan killed and has head removed
OL,4,Ain city park
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have appealed for information
OL,7,Fafter a swan was killed and its head
OL,8,Fremoved in a Leeds park.
OL,10,FThe animal was found in Roundhay Park
OL,11,Fon Monday, close to the lake, a
OL,12,Fspokesperson for West Yorkshire Police
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,FUnder the Wildlife and Countryside Act,
OL,16,Fit is a criminal offence to kill a swan
OL,17,Fin the UK.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
