OL,3,GNEWSASwan killed and has head removed
OL,4,Ain city park
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn RSPCA spokesperson said: "We know
OL,7,Fhow much people love seeing these
OL,8,Fpopular birds in their local community
OL,9,Fand this incident will be very
OL,10,Fupsetting for everyone who enjoys
OL,11,Fcoming to this park."
